  _forground: {fileID: 0}
  _senarioDescription: 'You look closely at the details of your room and still nothing
    catches your eye. As you were about to stop and decide your next plan of action,
    you caught a glimpse of reflecting moonlight from under your bed. You think to
    yourself, there isn''t or shouldn''t be anything under your bed. Creeped out
    and a bit shaky, you make your next decision. Enter through the window or go
    back to the study window. '
